sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant W as Storefront widget
    participant B as Backend (validation + timeout)
    participant H as External webhook
    participant N as n8n (AI Agent / RAG)

    C->>W: Types a message
    W->>B: POST chat message
    Note over B: Validates length and body size<br/>Per-request/IP rate limiting: PLANNED, not yet implemented
    B->>H: Forwards message (bounded timeout, no retries)
    H->>N: Triggers AI workflow
    N-->>H: Generates reply (RAG-assisted)
    H-->>B: Returns reply JSON
    B-->>W: Returns reply or a localized error
    Note over W: Reply is parsed as Markdown,<br/>then sanitized (DOMPurify, explicit allowlist)<br/>before being rendered
    W-->>C: Displays the response
